# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# AEGIS AI — Development Environment Configuration
# Copy this to .env and fill in real values
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

ENVIRONMENT=development
DEBUG=true
PROJECT_NAME="AEGIS AI"
VERSION=2.0.0

# ── Server ──────────────────────────────────────────────
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8000
WORKERS=1

# ── Security ────────────────────────────────────────────
SECRET_KEY=aegis-dev-secret-key-change-in-production-abc123xyz
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_EXPIRE_MINUTES=1440

# ── Database (PostgreSQL) ───────────────────────────────
# Set to empty string to use in-memory mode (no Postgres needed)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://aegis:REPLACE_ME__ROTATE_IMMEDIATELY@localhost:5432/aegis
# DATABASE_URL=  # Leave empty to skip DB (demo mode)

# ── Redis / Event Bus ───────────────────────────────────
# Set to empty string to use in-memory fallback (no Redis needed)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
# REDIS_URL=  # Leave empty to skip Redis (demo mode)

# ── OBS WebSocket ───────────────────────────────────────
OBS_WS_URL=ws://localhost:4455
OBS_PASSWORD=REPLACE_ME__ROTATE_IMMEDIATELY
# Leave OBS_PASSWORD empty if OBS has no password set

# ── AI / Commentary ─────────────────────────────────────
# OpenAI (for best commentary quality)
OPENAI_API_KEY=REPLACE_ME__ROTATE_IMMEDIATELY
# Gemini (alternative)
GEMINI_API_KEY=REPLACE_ME__ROTATE_IMMEDIATELY
# ElevenLabs (for voice synthesis)
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=REPLACE_ME__ROTATE_IMMEDIATELY
# Ollama local model (free, no API key needed): ollama pull llama3
LLM_MODEL=llama3
LLM_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:11434/v1

# ── Computer Vision ─────────────────────────────────────
YOLO_MODEL_PATH=yolov8n.pt
YOLO_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD=0.45
# Set to true if you have NVIDIA GPU with CUDA
USE_GPU=false

# ── Broadcast Settings ──────────────────────────────────
MIN_SCENE_TIME_SECONDS=10
MAX_SWITCHES_PER_MINUTE=8

# ── Feature Flags ───────────────────────────────────────
ENABLE_AI_COMMENTARY=true
ENABLE_FIGHT_PREDICTION=true
ENABLE_AUTO_HIGHLIGHTS=true
ENABLE_OBS_CONTROL=false
ENABLE_VISION_PIPELINE=false

# ── CORS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000","http://localhost:3001","http://localhost:3002"]
